Demand period,Setup,holding,2,float32,,,,min,RW,,,,,"0, 5, 8, 10, 15, 20, 30 or 60 minutes, default 60. 0 makes demand show the present value and max demand the maximum since the last reset"
System type,Setup,holding,10,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"3 = 3P4W, 2 = 3P3W, 1 = 1P2W. Needs the password"
Pulse 1 width,Setup,holding,12,float32,,,,ms,RW,,,,,"60, 100 or 200 ms, default 100"
Password lock,Setup,holding,14,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"Reads 0 = locked, 1 = unlocked; writing any value locks. Reading also restarts the one-minute password timeout"
Network parity and stop bits,Setup,holding,18,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"0 = no parity, 1 stop bit (default); 1 = even, 1 stop; 2 = odd, 1 stop; 3 = no parity, 2 stop. Takes effect after a restart"
Network node,Setup,holding,20,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"Modbus address 1 to 247, default 1. Takes effect after a restart"
Pulse 1 divisor,Setup,holding,22,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,"0 = 0.0025, 1 = 0.01, 2 = 0.1, 3 = 1, 4 = 10, 5 = 100 kWh (kvarh) per pulse"
Password,Setup,holding,24,float32,,,,,RW,,,,,Write the password (default 0000) to unlock protected registers for one minute
